    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、【2024年沈阳航空航天大学1.2】 $f(t)$ 如下图，画出 $f(2t-2)$ 的图，并求 $\\frac{df(t)}{dt}$ 表达式。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            813,
            156
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/e19818fc2f35d6927d8eb0404304fdd702e5f1d6268b12c896b9586fb5592cb4.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            332,
            163,
            660,
            321
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $f(t) \\xrightarrow{\\text{右2}} f(t-2) \\xrightarrow{\\text{压缩}} f(2t-2)$",
        "bbox": [
            132,
            333,
            689,
            389
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/99b1edf9af7877be186aadae0e395bc8782a2b5baedff17de6498a8052275cae.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            282,
            391,
            771,
            507
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$f(t)$ 中除 $40f(t-1)$ 外求导为",
        "bbox": [
            131,
            570,
            408,
            610
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/76f87cf3b47550e33dcc17f08ab7515b926f2a59cd60a9b503d261f9c8a54c81.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            415,
            514,
            700,
            657
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{故} \\frac {d f (t)}{d t} = 4 \\delta^ {\\prime} (t + 1) - \\delta (t - 2) + u (t + 1) - u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
