            475
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "易有同学想. $x(-x-2)$ 表式直接证明 it. 参考如下：",
        "bbox": [
            121,
            533,
            709,
            603
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①把多余的一2去掉 则 $x(-2t-2) \\rightarrow x(-2t+2-2) = x[-2(t-1)-2]$ 说明右1去掉-2",
        "bbox": [
            117,
            637,
            818,
            705
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "② 把 $x(2t)$ 中负号去掉 则 $x(-2t) \\rightarrow x(2t) = x[-2(-t)]$ 反转",
        "bbox": [
            117,
            720,
            739,
            809
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "③把 $x(x)$ 中2去掉 则 $x(x)$ $\\longrightarrow$ $x(2 \\cdot \\frac{t}{2}) = x(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            110,
            808,
            722,
            852
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
